      text A table consists of an ordered arrangement of rows and columns. This is a simplified description of the most basic kind of table. Certain considerations follow from this simplified description: @86,1614,595,61
      text the term has several common synonyms (e.g., , k-, n-tuple, vector); @86,1687,595,20
