      link https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Rollup_table.png https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Rollup_table.png @86,4251,595,21
      text An example of a table containing rows with summary information. The summary information consists of subtotals that are combined from previous rows within the same column. @86,4284,595,60
      text The concept of  is also a part of basic terminology. Any "simple" table can be represented as a "multi-dimensional" table by  the data values into ordered . A common example of such a table is a . @86,4356,595,61
      text dimension @86,4429,595,21
      link [7] #cite_note-7 @86,4462,595,20
      link normalizing https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Database_normalization @86,4494,595,20
