      row @86,5422,595,21
        h2 Generic representation @86,5422,193,21
        link edit @291,5422,25,21
      text As a communication tool, a table allows a form of of information from an unlimited number of different social or scientific contexts. It provides a familiar way to convey information that might otherwise not be obvious or readily understood. @86,5455,595,61
      link generalization https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Generalization @86,5528,595,20
      text For example, in the following diagram, two alternate representations of the same information are presented side by side. On the left is the NFPA 704 standard "" with example values indicated and on the right is a simple table displaying the same values, along with additional information. Both representations convey essentially the same information, but the tabular representation is arguably more comprehensible to someone who is not familiar with the NFPA 704 standard. The tabular representation may not, however, be ideal for every circumstance (for example because of space limitations, or safety reasons). @86,5560,595,163
      link "fire diamond" https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fire_diamond @86,5735,595,20
