      text Facing pages from a 1619 book of mathematical tables by , showing values for the sine, tangent and secant . Angles less than 45° are found on the left page, angles greater than 45° on the right. Cosine, cotangent and cosecant are found by using the entry on the opposite page. @86,8459,595,81
