      text are of information, usually numbers, showing the results of a calculation with varying arguments. were used in ancient Greece and India for applications to and , and continued to be widely used until became cheap and plentiful in the 1970s, in order to simplify and drastically speed up . Tables of and were common in math and science textbooks, and specialized tables were published for numerous applications. @86,8617,595,101
